cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Velaris capability format, please cite this repository
  as below. A preprint describing Velaris and this format is
  forthcoming; until it is published, this entry is the citation.
title: "velaris-spec: the Velaris capability format"
abstract: >-
  A specification of the effects a Velaris program may declare, the
  grammar an operator uses to grant them, what a runtime must refuse,
  the velaris.audit/1 and velaris.capabilities/1 JSON documents, an
  in-toto predicate type for the audit, and a language-independent
  conformance corpus at three levels. Its reference implementation is
  velaris-lang.
type: software
authors:
